{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7a5da8fa-d94d-88f9-9a95-2e31965c537d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:31:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Neusa Lopes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:28:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. Sorry, hold on one sec, I've got a box in my hands. [pause] Okay. I have a question about property tax, for a building I own on Kay Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Do you have the street number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:28:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 223 Kay Street. Up in the Historic Hill area. The name on it is Neusa Lopes, L-O-P-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:29:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, give me a moment to pull that up. [pause] Okay, I've got the account in front of me. What do you need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:29:16-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when is the next installment due? I honestly lost track of the last one, I think I paid it, but, um, I want to be sure about the next one. And does the city mail a reminder, or do I just have to remember?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:29:34-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Looks like your last installment is posted as paid, so you're good there. The next one is due at the next quarterly date, and that's coming up in a few weeks. Bills usually go out by mail ahead of each due date, but I wouldn't count on the mail alone. Put it on your calendar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, calendar. That's smart. Sorry, I'm, um, [inaudible] the shelf. One second. Okay. Which brings me to the other thing. How do I change the mailing address? Because the bills go to the building, and I'm basically never there. I'm at the shop all day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Easy enough. You'll want to send us the change in writing, with the property address, your name, and the new mailing address. You can mail it or drop it off here at City Hall. Once it's updated, the bills go to the new place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I just email it, or does it need to be paper?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd go with paper and a signature. That's the safest way to have it stick. If you want, I can note on the account that you're sending something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, please do that. I'll get it out this week. Honestly I'm slammed, one of my people called out again today, same person as always, so I'm covering the whole floor. That's why I'm running around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:31:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, the classic. Well, I've noted the account. If you want a callback number on it in case we have questions, I can add that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:31:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0156."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:31:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0156. Got it. Anything else on the tax side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:31:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Oh, wait, [crosstalk] sorry, no, that's it. The next installment, mail the address change, got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:31:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it. Good luck with the shelf, Ms. Lopes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:31:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
